/*
 * parser.gray:  Recursive descent parser for Grayscale. Transforms the token
 * stream from the lexer into an abstract syntax tree using Pratt parsing for
 * expressions and precedence-based operator handling.
 *
 * Author:  Marshall A Burns <marshallbcodes@gmail.com>
 * GitHub: @SchoolyB
 * Copyright (c) 2026-Present Marshall A Burns
